  <tag k="historic" v="memorial"/>
  <tag k="inscription" v="Here stood presbyterian St. Stephen's, an iron church brought from glasgow in 1855. In 1874 it housed the lending branch of the public library until removal to Lidcombe in 1879. It was demolished in 1958. This plaque is sponsored by Caltex"/>
